      "message": "Memory leak: `viewListProducer` is allocated with `new[]` (`new BufferView[...]`) but is never freed with `delete[]`. The same applies to `viewListConsumer` on line 169.\n\nPlease use `std::vector\u003cBufferView\u003e` (or `std::vector\u003cuint32_t\u003e`) instead of raw heap array allocation to ensure RAII memory management and avoid leaks. Also, on line 100 / 164, `nullptr` can be passed directly as the buffer pointer when querying the view count.\n\n*(Generated by Jetski)*",
